+  - `rejects invalid dueDates`: for each of `'14.10.2026'`, `'2026-02-30'`, `'2025-02-29'`, `'1900-02-29'`, `'2026-13-01'`, `'2026-00-10'`, `'2026-1-5'`, `''`, `20261014`, `true`, `{}` → `assert.throws(() => store.add({ title: 'A', dueDate: v }), (e) => e instanceof ValidationError && e.message === 'dueDate must be a valid date (YYYY-MM-DD) or null')`.
+  - `accepts leap days`: `'2028-02-29'` and `'2000-02-29'` accepted.
